  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">Founded in 2021, it initially started as an online store, and then established a physical store at The LOHAS in Tseung Kwan O.&nbsp; The founder, Mi Leung, is a fashion designer and yoga instructor who loves physical，mental and spiritual activities. Mi believes that in the busy life, we need a retreat and care for our body and mind.&nbsp; Therefore, in recent years, while designing yoga clothes, THE YOGI has also launched a variety of auxiliary products for the body or mind, hoping to bring high-quality products to busy urbanites for training purposes.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">創立於2021年，最初從網店開始, 再到將軍澳The LOHAS建立實體店。創辦人Mi Leung本是一位熱愛身心靈活動的時裝設計師及瑜伽導師，Mi 認為在忙碌的生活中， 必需要找尋喘息的空間， 關懷我們的身心靈。因此近年THE YOGI 設計瑜伽服外，亦推出多款為身體或心靈的輔助產品，希望給忙碌的</span><wbr style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); float: none; display: inline;\">都市人帶來優質產品配合訓練之用。</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Product description:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Yoga Clothes / Yoga Mat / Yoga Wheel / Meditation Zafu ( Cushion ) / Nepal Singing Bowl</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-w